{"3336520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dinotica", "steam_appid": 3336520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This sandbox roguelite puts you in the middle of a dense jungle with only your wit and wild friends to survive. Explore the world around you as you build a prehistoric paradise for you and the companions you capture and tame along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/7ba1350db6511222e12bdd791402dc99.avif?t=1786692940\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras_big/7ba1350db6511222e12bdd791402dc99.avif?t=1786692940 width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, tame, and collect a variety of dangerous yet helpful companions to help you on your journey. You’ll need to build, farm, and fight together to create your ultimate home in this mysterious new world. As your settlement grows, you’ll breed different creatures together to create stronger companions with a diverse range of abilities and find the perfect team for whatever task you’re working on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/c0721c8104c213598a4a453811516589.poster.avif?t=1786692940\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/c0721c8104c213598a4a453811516589.webm?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/c0721c8104c213598a4a453811516589.mp4?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/796556f00121c9b02546269506b2260d.avif?t=1786692940\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras_big/796556f00121c9b02546269506b2260d.avif?t=1786692940 width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring along your strongest fighters to take down the enemies that stalk the nearby jungle. As you dive deeper into the depths, you’ll encounter stronger and more dangerous enemies. Train your friends and develop their skills to take down tougher and tougher foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/767ed8cc64bdcfb42fe569ac7bda8158.poster.avif?t=1786692940\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/767ed8cc64bdcfb42fe569ac7bda8158.webm?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/767ed8cc64bdcfb42fe569ac7bda8158.mp4?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/a9b0ced9b07a96c6400609d0237cd5e1.avif?t=1786692940\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras_big/a9b0ced9b07a96c6400609d0237cd5e1.avif?t=1786692940 width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, unlock new technologies, and freely design and expand your home base into a thriving settlement with the help of your creature companions! You’ll be able to create farms your companions can tend and harvest, lay down beds for your fierce friends to sleep in, and put up decorations to make your settlement truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/7536ba39a68728a770ddcb7b46b62fb6.poster.avif?t=1786692940\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/7536ba39a68728a770ddcb7b46b62fb6.webm?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/7536ba39a68728a770ddcb7b46b62fb6.mp4?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/d179bc1bf8754e9dfbf78ec5f4ac4b4f.avif?t=1786692940\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras_big/d179bc1bf8754e9dfbf78ec5f4ac4b4f.avif?t=1786692940 width=1560 height=324 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hand-in-hand with your dinosaur companions to plant, water, fertilize, and harvest crops. Together, build a fully functional and flourishing farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/36860100b2fcb4c03eaee25914e58396.poster.avif?t=1786692940\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/36860100b2fcb4c03eaee25914e58396.webm?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/36860100b2fcb4c03eaee25914e58396.mp4?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This sandbox roguelite puts you in the middle of a dense jungle with only your wit and wild friends to survive. Explore the world around you as you build a prehistoric paradise for you and the companions you capture and tame along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/7ba1350db6511222e12bdd791402dc99.avif?t=1786692940\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras_big/7ba1350db6511222e12bdd791402dc99.avif?t=1786692940 width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, tame, and collect a variety of dangerous yet helpful companions to help you on your journey. You’ll need to build, farm, and fight together to create your ultimate home in this mysterious new world. As your settlement grows, you’ll breed different creatures together to create stronger companions with a diverse range of abilities and find the perfect team for whatever task you’re working on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/c0721c8104c213598a4a453811516589.poster.avif?t=1786692940\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/c0721c8104c213598a4a453811516589.webm?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336520/extras/c0721c8104c213598a4a453811516589.mp4?t=1786692940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_p